  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Somalia Stability Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The planned impact is to enhance Stability in Somalia. The overall objective is to ensure that targeted government institutions are more legitimate and capable to perform their functions, violent conflict has been reduced, gender equality enhanced, and opportunities for socio-economic development are accessible to a wider section of the population in the targeted areas. The Somali Stability Fund is a multi-donor instrument comprising of 7 donors with a Lead Donor and a Fund Manager.</narrative>
  </description>
